  "thag1.119:0.4": "1. 12. 9. kimbilattheragāthā. ",
  "thag1.119:1.1": "rukkhamūlagahanaṃ pasakkiya ",
  "thag1.119:1.2": "nibbānaṃ hadayasmiṃ opiya ",
  "thag1.119:1.3": "jhāya gotama mā ca pāmado ",
  "thag1.119:1.4": "kiṃ te bilibilikā karissatī’ti. itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ",
  "thag1.119:1.5": "vajjiputto thero gāthaṃ abhāsitthā’ti. "
}
